goal	Keep an autonomous repair moving while evidence and repository state remain available to inspect.
state	The repair is incomplete, logs and repository files are available, and no credential, physical action, external job, or unresolved product decision blocks further investigation.
unresolved	Inspect the remaining failure and continue the repair.
done_when	The repair is verified complete or a concrete WAIT or HUMAN boundary is established.
